title: A click on the right half of a letter puts the caret after that letter (depends on where goto frames a.txt: the f of "second of a" is at x 980-1018, y 325)
prefs: {"minimap": false}
folders: edit-odd
limit: 40
forbid-log: cannot edit
expect-file: edit-odd/a.txt :: (?-i)\Afirst of a\nsecond of@ a\n\z

wait 3000
goto a.txt
wait 1200
tool edit
click 1010 325
type @
wait 300
mark clicked
wait 400
key save
wait 600
quit
